  "sourceInterpretation": [
    "The reviewed upstream ProxyManager source discovers default proxies by inspecting managed stack frames. This is consistent with the observed LoadDefaultProxies exception and retained-boundary repair; it is not a claim that the runner's .NET Framework binary byte-matches this upstream source.",
    "WindowsEditBox.SetValue validates writability and sends WM_SETTEXT. WindowsComboBox.SetValue delegates to the edit and additionally sends CBN_EDITUPDATE to its parent. This supports the measured destination-propagation investigation; the strict parent candidate still requires actual native validation."
  ],
